1kd5|n|A covered and inclosed entrance to a building, whether taken from the interior, and forming a sort of vestibule within the main wall, or projecting without and with a separate roof. Sometimes the porch is large enough to serve as a covered walk. See also Carriage porch, under Carriage, and Loggia. ; A portico; a covered walk.	n:tgm,52,2~tgm,52,2	N:1649,49,3~1649,49,3
